@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #466482
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title D 数据层：组织身份
left to right direction
entity "部门\ndepartments" as departments {
  * id : text <<PK>>
  * name : text
}
entity "账号\nusers" as users {
  * id : text <<PK>>
  * username : text
  * name : text
  * password_hash : text
  * role : text
  department_id : text <<FK>>
  * payable : boolean
  * active : boolean
}
entity "会话\nsessions" as sessions {
  * token_hash : text <<PK>>
  * user_id : text <<FK>>
  * expires_at : timestamp with time zone
}
sessions --> users : (user_id)
users --> departments : (department_id)
legend bottom
箭头为外键依赖（指向被引用表），不是流程。
* 非空；PK主键；FK外键。完整唯一与检查约束见数据字典。
跨分区外键未全部显示，完整外键表列出所有79项。
endlegend

@enduml
